   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "During the first 100 days of Franklin Roosevelt’s administration, the policies enacted showed",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1172496,
     "content_html": "Congress was being an effective check on executive authority"
    },
    {
     "id": 1172495,
     "content_html": "a balanced budget was attainable"
    },
    {
     "id": 1172497,
     "content_html": "Congress was willing to follow the president’s lead"
    },
    {
     "id": 1172494,
     "content_html": "the administration had a well-thought out, organized plan to end the Great Depression"
    }
